    "description": "Barracks, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 439 blocks vs 290 (first build 388 vs 245). Long stone and timber house (7 x 11, spruce gable roof): six beds with footlockers along a centre aisle, an arms store by the door, a hearth under a brick chimney, a table and a weapon shelf at the back; the training dummy stands at the door. Not yet builder-tested: candle, carved_pumpkin, cornflower, red_banner. Decoration step adds: armor_stand, banner_pattern, item_frame.",
